IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q10-OVERDRAFT-ELIG.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SALARY          PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DEBT            PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-LIMIT           PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DEBT-PCT        PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-SAL-PCT         PIC 9(12) VALUE 0.
01 WS-MAX-LIMIT       PIC 9(10) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-SALARY
ACCEPT WS-DEBT
ACCEPT WS-LIMIT
COMPUTE WS-DEBT-PCT = WS-DEBT * 100
COMPUTE WS-SAL-PCT = WS-SALARY * 40
COMPUTE WS-MAX-LIMIT = WS-SALARY * 2
IF WS-SALARY > 0 AND WS-DEBT-PCT <= WS-SAL-PCT AND WS-LIMIT <= WS-MAX-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE"
ELSE
    DISPLAY "NOT ELIGIBLE"
END-IF
STOP RUN.
